{"version":1,"key":"card:618","content":{"id":618,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":":focus","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 伪类选择器选中当前获得焦点的元素"}]},{"type":"code-block","code":"<style>\n    #input {\n        width: 300px;\n        height: 48px;\n        border-radius: 24px;\n        outline: 2px solid rgb(255, 255, 255, 10%);\n      \toutline-offset: -2px;\n        display: flex;\n        align-items: center;\n        padding: 0 16px;\n        font-weight: 600;\n      \tmargin: 0 auto;\n      \tfont-size: 15px;\n    }\n\n    #input:focus {\n        outline-color: #ffd061;\n    }\n</style>\n<input id=\"input\" placeholder=\"Input Here\" />","language":"HTML","uuid":"44e4fc19-8ce7-41a7-ac99-786087cce21c","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"html-block","html":"<style>\n    [data-theme=\"light\"] #input1 {\n      outline-color: rgb(0, 0, 0, 10%)\n    }\n    #input1 {\n        background: #302F33;\n        width: 300px;\n        height: 48px;\n        border-radius: 24px;\n        outline: 2px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 10%);\n        display: flex;\n        align-items: center;\n        padding: 0 16px;\n        font-weight: 600;\n      \tcolor: #fff;\n      \toutline-offset: -2px;\n      \tmargin: 0 auto;\n      \ttransition: outline-color 0.2s;\n    }\n\n    #input1:focus {\n        outline-color: #ffd061!important;\n    }\n</style>\n<input id=\"input1\" placeholder=\"Input Here\" />","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"出于某些目的，我们希望给可聚焦的元素会添加一些容器，比如要显示自定义的错误，此时会将这个容器当作是一个可聚焦的元素，当内部实际的可聚焦的元素聚焦时，外部的容器能够表现出特殊的样式，在无特殊选择器的情况下，需要使用 JavaScript 监听内部可聚焦元素的 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"focus","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 和 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"blur","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 方法，然后给外部容器添加不同的类来显示不同的效果。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"现在可以直接通过 "},{"type":"formatted","text":":focus-within","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 选择器来实现这一目的。"},{"type":"formatted","text":":focus-within","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 选择器会选中当元素自身聚焦或者子孙元素聚焦的元素"}]},{"type":"code-block","code":"<style>\n    #input-container {\n        width: 300px;\n        display: flex;\n        align-items: center;\n        background: #302F33;\n        height: 48px;\n        border-radius: 24px;\n        outline: 2px solid #E95C3D;\n        outline-offset: -2px;\n        padding: 0 16px;\n        font-weight: 600;\n        color: #fff;\n        margin: 0 auto;\n        font-size: 15px;\n    }\n    #input-container:focus-within {\n      outline-color: #ffd061;\n    }\n    #input {\n        min-width: 0;\n        flex: 1;\n        background: transparent;\n        outline: none;\n        border: none;\n    }\n    #input-error {\n        flex: none;\n        color: #E95C3D;\n        font-size: 13px;\n    }\n</style>\n<div id=\"input-container\">\n  <input id=\"input\" placeholder=\"Input Here\" />\n  <div id=\"input-error\">Name Required</div>\n</div>","language":"HTML","uuid":"24dce6a7-942c-4f89-a663-2659f3c4553f","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"html-block","html":"<style>\n    #input-container {\n        width: 300px;\n        display: flex;\n        align-items: center;\n        background: #302F33;\n        height: 48px;\n        border-radius: 24px;\n        outline: 2px solid #E95C3D;\n        outline-offset: -2px;\n        padding: 0 16px;\n        font-weight: 600;\n        color: #fff;\n        margin: 0 auto;\n        font-size: 15px;\n      \ttransition: outline-color 0.2s;\n    }\n  \t#input-container:focus-within {\n      outline-color: #ffd061;\n    }\n    #input {\n        min-width: 0;\n        flex: 1;\n        background: transparent;\n        outline: none;\n        border: none;\n    }\n    #input-error {\n        flex: none;\n        color: #E95C3D;\n        font-size: 13px;\n    }\n</style>\n<div id=\"input-container\">\n  <input id=\"input\" placeholder=\"Input Here\" />\n  <div id=\"input-error\">Name Required</div>\n</di","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}],"tags":["CSS/选择器"],"createTime":1755858985715,"updateTime":1755938334489,"linkedCards":[]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1755938334489},"pluginRenderers":[{"runtimeVersion":1,"manifest":{"formatVersion":1,"id":"tau.html","name":"HTML","version":"0.1.4","minAppVersion":"0.59.0","apiVersion":1,"platform":"desktop","format":"cjs","main":"main.js","editor":true,"categories":["editor","ai"],"keywords":["HTML","网页","嵌入"],"integrity":{"main.js":"eafe74429244b57e1dce6a889e1e925f0cf178f5942afe95485f081a8fa048bf","main.css":"468f2feb73a33e5711b1583b609e4ab3818e83d5f19a38dcd9d027b77eb269d8"},"styles":"main.css"},"entry":"../../plugin-assets/tau.html/0.1.4/7b4be5bc83e3b665c52aeaddc0c146d56eb1864201e835bf5ebaba71b8eb1536/main.js","styles":"../../plugin-assets/tau.html/0.1.4/7b4be5bc83e3b665c52aeaddc0c146d56eb1864201e835bf5ebaba71b8eb1536/style.css","nodeTypes":["html-block","html-inline"]}],"contentStyles":[{"href":"../styles/be7c0626fcfe953888cad6ea730acc5ac9b2d19c528faea8cd23816205fe44f2.css","integrity":"be7c0626fcfe953888cad6ea730acc5ac9b2d19c528faea8cd23816205fe44f2"}]}